            {
              "answer": "dördü",
              "why": "*Dördü* goes with *geçiyor*, past four. **To** four takes the dative: *dörde*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "**To** the hour: dative + *var*. The t of *dört* softens before the vowel: *dörde çeyrek var*."
